      ],
      "sha256": "019ce18f75c5fb666a796def82af70e96e6059c1120e5524494aa3e7af79ac5f",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 6. Completion-time histogram for 20 video and 20 chat.codes participants who finished the task. Counts in time bins 0–2, 2–4, 4–6, 6–8, 8–10, 10–12, 12–20 and over 20 minutes are: video 0, 4, 6, 2, 1, 2, 3, 2; chat.codes 2, 7, 1, 3, 2, 2, 3, 0. Video is blue and chat.codes red. Chat.codes has more completions under four minutes, but the source reports the overall mean-time difference was not statistically significant."
    }
